; Enhanced Echo Tops, kft -- ramp tuned to where the data actually lives.
;
; The WCT table (ET.pal) reserves red/white/magenta for 60-75 kft, but a real
; scan puts 99.6% of its gates below 50 and none above 60, so its whole hot end
; is dead and a 56 kft top -- which is a serious storm -- draws mid-scale
; yellow. This reaches vivid red at 43 and keeps 45+ for the extremes, so the
; colour tracks how unusual the top is rather than how close it is to 75.

Product: EET
Units: KFT
Step: 5

